# Innocent Blood makes each player sacrifice a creature at once (CR 701.21a, 101.4): Bot1 sacrifices the Devil, its only creature, and
# Bot2 its Llanowar Elves. The Devil looks back (CR 603.10a) and triggers separately for each permanent (CR 603.2c, no batching): two
# triggers, Bot1 aims one at itself (its own target is legal) and one at Bot2, so both end on 19.

